plugins/aid-orchestrator/defaults/enforcement-registry.yaml:1071:    description: "P061 E1 Step 3: plan.json.gates[] (Step 1) is a hard floor at the GATES:DONE FSM precondition — profile_exclusion (above) alone does not fail overall, so without this check a plan-required gate excluded by --profile could vanish from a run reporting overall=pass; check_preconditions cross-references plan.json.gates[] against gates_report.json.excluded_gates[] and refuses the transition (fail-loud design, not a forced re-run) on any overlap, reason: plan_gate_profile_excluded; --force + reason>=20 chars remains the only override, same as sibling GATES:DONE checks; closes the profile/plan silent-exclusion gap"
